Summary
GoodDollarExpansionController::mintUBIFromReserveBalance()
or
GoodDollarExpansionController::mintUBIFromInterest()
transfer funds to the reserve and mint $G to the distribution helper. However,
GoodDollarExchangeProvider::mintFromInterest()
