Make the following change in the
checkpoint
function where the eviction condition is checked:
----new code block----
 // Evict inactive services
 if (numServices > 0) {
                _evict(evictServiceIds, serviceInactivity, numServices);
                serviceIds = getServiceIds();
            }
----end of code block ----
