contract, the owner has to call
transferOwnership()
to nominate a pending owner. Afterwards, the pending owner must call
acceptOwnership()
to become the new owner.
When called by the owner,
transferOwnership()
executes the following logic:
LSP0ERC725AccountCore.sol#L560-L580
----new code block----
