Submitted by berndartmueller, also found by CertoraInc, m9800, and scaraven
When creating a new governance proposal, the
proposalId
is generated by hashing the proposal data (
_targets, _values, _calldatas, descriptionHash
). To prevent duplicated proposals, the current
Governor
implementation checks if the
